WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.000
Anthropic's AI runs

00:00:01.812 --> 00:00:02.743
on gas and

00:00:02.555 --> 00:00:03.133
coal

00:00:03.654 --> 00:00:04.538
According to a

00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:06.578
new breakdown by 2028

00:00:06.803 --> 00:00:08.111
87 percent of the

00:00:07.923 --> 00:00:09.620
power behind Anthropic's

00:00:09.468 --> 00:00:10.092
AI

00:00:10.258 --> 00:00:11.071
will come from

00:00:10.883 --> 00:00:11.908
natural gas

00:00:11.932 --> 00:00:13.512
and 11 percent from

00:00:13.324 --> 00:00:13.901
coal

00:00:14.422 --> 00:00:15.518
Its power use

00:00:15.330 --> 00:00:16.745
could emit 17

00:00:16.556 --> 00:00:17.747
to 38 million

00:00:17.559 --> 00:00:18.855
tons of CO2

00:00:18.667 --> 00:00:19.292
a year

00:00:19.434 --> 00:00:20.318
more than all

00:00:20.130 --> 00:00:21.580
of California's power

00:00:21.391 --> 00:00:22.275
generation

00:00:22.814 --> 00:00:23.651
Four in five

00:00:23.474 --> 00:00:24.724
on-site generators

00:00:24.536 --> 00:00:26.222
use inefficient simple-cycle

00:00:26.033 --> 00:00:26.835
turbines

00:00:26.906 --> 00:00:27.755
and the AI

00:00:27.566 --> 00:00:28.710
boom keeps adding

00:00:28.522 --> 00:00:29.276
demand

00:00:29.814 --> 00:00:30.828
Full story on

00:00:30.639 --> 00:00:31.535
the dashboard
